    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Yeowas Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniarei ka ŋiuni ipukat Yoas lokoku ka Aasia Yudaya, kisyak Yeowas lokoku a Yeu akipuka Isirael alo Samaria. Arae ŋikaru ŋulu epukator iŋes ŋitomon ka ŋikanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyae iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon. Abu iŋes nyeki akitiya ŋasecisya ŋuna ekote ŋuna arikokinia Yeroboam, lokoku a Nebat, Ŋisirael nasecit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon tolili nooi neni a Ŋisirael, tosodi tocamak Asael erwosit ka Aram ka Benadad lokoku keŋ akilounun Ŋisirael a ŋina paki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu Yeowas erwosit kikalou neni ke Ekapolon, kiira Ekapolon akilip keŋ, anerae abu kiŋolik ŋican ŋulu arukaunito Ŋisirael aŋuna esicanitor erwosit ka Aram ikes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, inak Ekapolon Ŋisirael ekaiunan ikotere ikes eiunosi aneni a ŋituŋa ka Aram; toboŋosi akiboi emam ŋace lorerya kec, nenipei sek eboiyoto ka aŋorot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari kikote nen, daŋ apotu ikes nyekiwa asecenen asecit ŋina ekoni ŋina a ekal a Yeroboam a ŋolo arikokini Ŋisirael nasecit. Apotu torubakis eseceneneete, torubakis itowoito epir ŋolo a Baal alo Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, aponi tomunyarae ŋasigarya a Yeowas, topuunos ŋasigarya ŋuna ameto ŋaŋolei erae ŋatomonikan ka ŋagaari ŋatomon ta ŋulu alosete a ŋakejen ŋalipyo ŋatomon, ŋul bon apotu topuunos, anerae abu erwosit ka Aram toar ikes nooi kilou. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Yeowas ŋuluce daadaŋ ka ŋuna daadaŋ etiyat iŋes kaapei ka arwonu keŋ, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeowas totwana, tonukae akuwan keŋ Samaria, tosodi Yeoas ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kipuka Yeoas Isirael",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alokaru a ŋolo a ŋatomoniuni ka ŋikanikaarei ipukat Yoas Yudaya, kisyak Yeoas lokoku a Yeowas akipuka Isirael alo Samaria. Kipuka iŋes ŋikaru ŋitomon ka ŋikanikapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyae iŋes daŋ ŋuna aronok aneni ke Ekapolon. Abu nyeki akitiya ŋasecisya ŋuna ekote ŋuna arikokinia Yeroboam a lokoku a Nebat Ŋisirael nasecit. Torubak iŋes itiyae aronis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo a Yeoas ŋuluce daadaŋ ka daadaŋ ŋuna etiyae iŋes kaapei ka arwonu keŋ ŋina ajioto ka Amasia erwosit ŋolo a Yudaya, igiritae lokitaabo ŋolo a ŋakiro a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yeoas totwana, tosodi Yeroboam kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka Ŋisirael. Aponi tonukae akuwan a Yeoas Samaria neni anukitae ŋirwosi a Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare ŋina ke Elisa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Elisa ŋolo arae ekadwaran todyakakin edeke ŋolo abu toar iŋes. Tolot Yeoas erwosit a Isirael neni keŋ togeu akigworo tema, “Aa papa! Aa papa! Iyoŋ ipolokinit ŋajiorei a Ŋisirael!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Elisa iŋes tema, “Tolemu akau a ŋikaleŋeleŋe ka ŋikaleŋeleŋe.” Tosodi iŋes tolemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirworik nai Elisa neni ke erwosit tema, “Kiketak akau a ŋikaleŋeleŋe.” Tosodi erwosit kiketak, kidokok Elisa ŋakan keŋ kidiyama ŋuna ke erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Elisa, “Toŋaa edirisa ŋolo alowae a ŋolo alo Kide.” Abu erwosit toŋaa. Tema Elisa, “Toguma.” Tosodi erwosit toguma ekaleŋeleŋet. Kirworik nai Elisa tema, “Erae ŋol ekaleŋeleŋet ŋolo ilounia Ekapolon ŋituŋa ŋulu ka Aram! Ilosi iyoŋ ejie ka ŋituŋa ka Aram aneni enyaritae Apek akitodol ŋina imunyarya ikes.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torubak Elisa irworo ebala, “Tolemu ŋikaleŋeleŋe.” Tolemu erwosit. Tema Elisa, “Togumak ikes kwap.” Togumak erwosit ŋikaleŋeleŋe kwap ŋagumaret ŋauni tojoŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toŋo Elisa neni ke erwosit kisibura iŋes tema, “Amaikina iyoŋ togumak ŋagumaret ŋakan kori ŋakanikapei, ikotere kilou jik ŋituŋa ka Aram. Nai tokona ilosi iyoŋ akiloun ikes ŋakilouneta ŋauni make.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Elisa totwan, tonukae. Ŋirwa ŋul anaito ŋajiorei a ŋituŋa a Moab aponenen akirem akwap a Ŋisirael apaki ŋina ka akicereet a akiporo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit apei, apotu ŋituŋa yaasi akinuk ituŋanan ŋini atwani, ani eriŋa ikes edakito ituŋanan ŋin, toanyuwasi ajiore, tosodo tosuros ŋituŋa, tocakakis ekile ŋolo atwan nalyal ŋina ke Elisa. Ŋinapei atapakinor akuwan a ekile a ŋolo atwan nakoyo ke Elisa, toyaru ekile ŋol towo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Todemut Ŋisirael Aram ŋitaunio ŋulu sek ekamaritae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋirwa daadaŋ ŋulu epukator Yeowas, arukaunito Ŋisirael ŋican aneni ka Asael a ŋolo arae erwosit ka Aram. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai, abu Ekapolon tominak ikes kisyonik. Totamu Ekapolon ikes aŋuna ka acamunet keŋ ka Aburaam ka Isaka ta Yakob, toesik amunyar ikes. Akitodol tari tokona, eriŋa Ekapolon nyiritara ikes aneni keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani etwani Asael ŋolo arae erwosit ka Aram, abu Benadad ŋolo arae lokoku keŋ, kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ kipuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
